ABLE.md}`; the Master Plan is `MASTER-PLAN.md`.\n\n## Core honesty properties (the spine â€” NS4)\n- Every forward claim (a situate frame or an anticipation) is honestly **risk-labeled** and EARNS its tier by\n  an **independent named-defeater refutation**; only the **REFUTED** is dropped; nothing unverified is asserted\n  as real; no self-CORROBORATED (unverifiable â†’ researchPrime handoff).\n- **Single-family ceiling = PROMISING** (GROUNDED requires a cross-family refuter) â€” a machine-checked invariant.\n- It COMPOSES the diagnose core + researchPrime; it does NOT brainstorm (Jumper, a later skill that composes\n  Gandalf), reimplement researchPrime, or run Crucible's multi-plan refutation engine.\n\n## Build architecture â€” three decoupled increments (see MASTER-PLAN.md)\n- **Increment 1 (Gandalf v1, the committed shippable skill):** diagnose + situate + anticipate + honest tiered\n  labeling, green on the existing trio `agent()` seam with anti-laundering as an honor-system checklist\n  (B2â€²/B7â€² stamped BLOCKED-this-cycle). Independent of the ledger and the oracle.\n- **Increment 2 (machine-checked anti-laundering):** unblocks when the shared Phase-0 commission-id ledger\n  lands (external precondition).\n- **Increment 3 (elevation-efficacy proof):** the must-elevate oracle, staged behind a feasibility gate; an\n  infeasible oracle yields an honest \"efficacy UNPROVEN,\" not a whole-skill block.\n\n## Done-floor + gate discipline (PRINCIPLE-D)\nThe ground-truth gate is the deterministic canary/test suite (`node --test test/*.test.mjs`). The elevation\noracle and any LLM/cross-family judging are **ADVISORY**, isolated OUT of the gate command (an unreachable\njudge leaves the gate GREEN â€” proven by a meta-isolation test). Single-family substrate â†’ cross_model:false.\n","numLines":34,"startLine":1,"totalLines":34}}}
